  "description": {
    "en": "Luxilon Eco Spin is a durable pentagonal polyester string made from 100% recycled materials and is biodegradable. Designed for ultimate precision, exceptional spin and excellent tension maintenance, it delivers a controlled response for ambitious players while providing a more sustainable choice without sacrificing performance.",

    "zh": "Luxilon Eco Spin 是一款采用 100% 再生材料制造，并具备可生物降解特性的五边形聚酯球线。它强调极高的控制力、旋转能力以及优异的保磅性能，适合追求精准击球与现代旋转打法的中高级球员，同时也是 Luxilon 环保系列中定位最偏向控制型的一款产品。"
  },

